  "solution": "Given equation: 104 ÷ 4 - 6 + 13 × 5 = 22.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\n**Option 1) 13 and 4**\n\nGiven: 104 ÷ 4 - 6 + 13 × 5 = 22\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**104 ÷ 13**__ - 6 + 4 × 5 = 22\n\n⇒ 8 - 6 + __**4**____** × 5**__ = 22\n\n⇒ __**8**__ - 6 __**+ **__**__**2**__0** = 22\n\n⇒ __28 - 6__ = 22\n\n⇒ **22 = 22**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 2) 6 and 4\n\nGiven: 104 ÷ 4 - 6 + 13 × 5 = 22\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**104 ÷ 6**__ - 4 + 13 × 5 = 22\n\n⇒ 17.33 - 4 + __**13 × 5**__ = 22\n\n⇒ __**17.33**__ - 4 __**+ 65**__ = 22\n\n⇒ 82.33 - 4 = 22\n\n⇒ 78.33 ≠ 22\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) 6 and 5\n\nGiven: 104 ÷ 4 - 6 + 13 × 5 = 22\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**104 ÷ 4**__ - 5 + 13 × 6 = 22\n\n⇒ 26 - 5 + __**13 × 6**__ = 22\n\n⇒ __**26**__ - 5 __**+ 78**__ = 22\n\n⇒ __104 - 5__ = 22\n\n⇒ 99 ≠ 22\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) 13 and 6\n\nGiven: 104 ÷ 4 - 6 + 13 × 5 = 22\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**104 ÷ 4**__ - 13 + 6 × 5 = 22\n\n⇒ 26 - 13 + __**6**____** × 5**__ = 22\n\n⇒ __**26**__ - 13 __**+ 30**__ = 22\n\n⇒ __56 -____ 13__ = 22\n\n⇒ 43 ≠ 22\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 1\".",
